## Third-party code included in this repository

One file is not covered by the MIT licence above.

`src/components/ui/spotlightCard.tsx` is adapted from React Bits
(https://reactbits.dev, DavidHDev/react-bits), which is licensed
**MIT + Commons Clause**. The Commons Clause withholds the right to sell the
software, and forbids redistributing the components "alone, in a bundle, or as
a ported version". The file was copied in individually rather than installed —
React Bits has no npm package and distributes by copying — and it retains its
attribution header. See `docs/agents/dependencies.md` for the decision and for
the tiers of that library that are ruled out here.

Everything else in this repository is MIT, as above.
